msgstr "Jusqu'au %(date)s"

#: templates/owners_manage.html:38
msgid "Unknown"
msgstr "Inconnue"

#: templates/owners_manage.html:42
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "Retirer"

#: templates/owners_manage.html:50
msgid "No owner assigned: the asset counts for the whole household."
msgstr "Aucun propriétaire attribué : l'actif compte pour tout le foyer."

#: templates/owners_manage.html:56
msgid "Add or update an owner"
msgstr "Ajouter ou modifier un propriétaire"

#: templates/owners_manage.html:69
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Dismembered rights are valued with article 669 CGI: a life usufruct from the "
"age of the usufructuary (90 %% before 21 years, 10 points less every ten "
"years, 10 %% from 91 years), a temporary usufruct at 23 %% per period of ten "
"years, the bare ownership being worth the rest."
msgstr ""
"Les droits démembrés sont valorisés selon l'article 669 du CGI : un usufruit "
"viager selon l'âge de l'usufruitier (90 %% avant 21 ans, 10 points de moins "
"tous les dix ans, 10 %% à partir de 91 ans), un usufruit temporaire à 23 %% "
"par période de dix ans, la nue-propriété valant le reste."

